sequenceDiagram
    participant WF as Workflow Service
    participant PayVer as Payment Verification Service
    participant Bank as Bank SDK
    participant Disb as Disbursement Service
    participant NACH as NACH SDK
    participant PaySDK as Payment SDK
    participant DB as Disbursement DB
    participant Outbox as Transactional Outbox
    participant Kafka as Event Bus (Kafka)

    WF->>PayVer: Validate bank account
    PayVer->>Bank: Verify IFSC & account number
    Bank-->>PayVer: Account valid
    PayVer->>Kafka: Publish PAYMENT_ACCOUNT_VERIFIED
    
    WF->>Disb: Initiate disbursement
    Disb->>NACH: Create NACH mandate
    NACH-->>Disb: Mandate initiated
    
    Disb->>DB: Persist NACH status
    Disb->>Outbox: Write DISBURSEMENT_NACH_INITIATED event
    DB-->>Disb: Commit
    Disb->>Kafka: Publish DISBURSEMENT_NACH_INITIATED
    
    WF-->>WF: Wait for NACH confirmation
    
    WF->>Disb: Execute fund transfer
    Disb->>PaySDK: Transfer funds (mocked)
    PaySDK-->>Disb: Transfer success
    
    Disb->>DB: Persist disbursement status (DISBURSED)
    Disb->>Outbox: Write DISBURSEMENT_COMPLETED event
    DB-->>Disb: Commit
    Disb->>Kafka: Publish DISBURSEMENT_COMPLETED
    Kafka-->>WF: Event consumed
    WF-->>WF: Mark loan DISBURSED
